[114.687543, "i", "cat >> reports/pr-482.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Operational note\n\nBefore teardown, unrelated ledger preview worker `i-0771` (`ledger-pr-77-worker`,\nproject `ledger`, env `pr-77`) occupied `subnet-4822`, blocking its deletion.\nIt was moved with `cloudctl instance move i-0771 --subnet subnet-0a12` to the\nexisting platform shared preview subnet, where the ledger API already runs.\nThe move restarted the worker; it was verified running afterward, with journal\nvolume `vol-0772` still attached and in use. No ledger resources were deleted.\nA before/after inventory comparison verified that all other resources were\nunchanged apart from this relocation and the seven pr-482 deletions above.\nEOF\n(set -e; report_sum=$(sha256sum reports/pr-482.md); state_before=$(cloudctl list --json); ./teardown.sh pr-482; test \"$(sha256sum reports/pr-482.md)\" = \"$report_sum\"; test \"$(cloudctl list --json)\" = \"$state_before\"; test \"$(cloudctl list --selector project=checkout,env=pr-482 --json | jq length)\" -eq 0; echo 'Verified live rerun: no changes"]
